    "summary": "First version for the AIGen Hub beta.",
    "bodyMd": "# Cookie Notice\n\nAIGen Hub uses only cookies that are needed for the service to work. We do not use advertising or third-party analytics cookies in the app.\n\n| Cookie | Purpose | Lasts |\n|---|---|---|\n| sb-…-auth-token | Keeps you signed in (set by our sign-in provider, Supabase) | Until you sign out, refreshed while you use the app |\n| hub_locale | Remembers your language | 1 year |\n| hub_company | Remembers which company you are working in | 1 year |\n\nBecause these cookies are strictly necessary, the app does not ask for consent to use them. If you block them, you will not be able to sign in.\n",
    "html": "<h1>Cookie Notice</h1>\n<p>AIGen Hub uses only cookies that are needed for the service to work. We do not use advertising or third-party analytics cookies in the app.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Cookie</th>\n<th>Purpose</th>\n<th>Lasts</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>sb-…-auth-token</td>\n<td>Keeps you signed in (set by our sign-in provider, Supabase)</td>\n<td>Until you sign out, refreshed while you use the app</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hub_locale</td>\n<td>Remembers your language</td>\n<td>1 year</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hub_company</td>\n<td>Remembers which company you are working in</td>\n<td>1 year</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Because these cookies are strictly necessary, the app does not ask for consent to use them. If you block them, you will not be able to sign in.</p>\n",
